WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.671
Warehouse replenishment in Quark WMS. Follow the web
application and RF workflow.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:17.703
Start with replenishment records in the web application.
Open a record to review the movement before following its
execution on RF.

3
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.020
Review the selected replenishment record and its details
in the web interface.

4
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.628
The demonstration now moves to the RF terminal for
execution on the warehouse floor.

5
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:56.084
Open Replenish from the RF inventory menu.

6
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:07.136
Identify the source location from which the stock will be
moved.

7
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:16.721
Review the planned quantity and enter the quantity to
move.

8
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:27.453
Bring the stock to the destination shown on the RF screen.

9
00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:33.786
Confirm the destination location.

10
00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:38.659
The Replenished screen confirms the movement at that
location.
